{"name": "Treasure Cove", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT IS TREASURE COVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Treasure Cove</strong> is a co-op survival horror adventure where <strong>you and your friends</strong> sail to a mysterious island in search of lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/5833157e1cd28224fe1996ce37c217be.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Communicate with your friends using <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>. Call for help, warn your crew about danger, and coordinate your search in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/9c524c6d3b2e2240b16ed035101ec87f.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> dangerous locations, use special tools to uncover hidden loot, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, <strong>upgrade</strong> your gear, and <strong>try</strong> to make it back to your ship before the island\u2019s monsters find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/3fced5ac910c86396ce70e5ef1e266c9.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>USE TOOLS TO FIND HIDDEN LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tools are your best chance to find treasure and make it back alive. Use a radar to detect buried valuables, a shovel to dig them up, and a flashlight to explore dark places where danger may be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/47e705c176273f6db7913cf56a12939a.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STAY QUIET OR GET HUNTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island is home to horrifying entities that stalk you in the darkness. Make too much noise, wander too far, or explore carelessly, and the hunt can quickly turn against you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/b0814f4c660e83615452d870b59f23e2.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE &amp; ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move carefully, stay alive, and return to the ship with your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.poster.avif?t=1786524812\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.webm?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/extras/99f792864b9cd20a69071c084dece66c.mp4?t=1786524812\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Survival Horror</strong> \u2014 explore the island with your friends and survive each expedition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Treasure Hunting</strong> \u2014 search for hidden treasures buried across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong> \u2014 communicate with your crew, but be careful: noise can attract monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Useful Tools</strong> \u2014 use a radar, shovel, flashlight, and map to find loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2014 sell treasures and buy better equipment for the next hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dangerous Monsters</strong> \u2014 use light or avoid terrifying creatures stalking the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong><br/><br/><br/><br/></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Treasure Cove is a co-op survival horror adventure where you and your friends set out to explore a mysterious island in search of lost treasures. With proximity voice chat, realistic visuals, and terrifying creatures lurking in the darkness, every expedition can quickly become a fight for survival.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905070/0e13a4932132f4af950506d56cf1cfc58e2a7c4b/header.jpg?t=1786524812", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Local Co-Op", "Online Co-Op", "Multiplayer", "Adventure", "Action"], "developers": "Team5", "publishers": "Team5", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3905070", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/C0agglONPN8", "first_seen": 1784246400.0}